<title>USA: New Milford, Conn., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>New Milford, Conn., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $2.850 million of New Milford, Conn., unlimited tax general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.699 percent.</p>
</text>
